      "writtenOn": "2024-11-14T20:12:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just like in Geocoder, this should never be null either. If it was somehow null, then it would probably fail somewhere else as well and a null pointer exception would have bubbled up sooner.\n\nIt would be useful to see a bug report or at least verbal reasoning of how we can get into this situation at all. Such a possibility would be dangerous for other parts of the code too and a guard-check like that would need to be inserted earlier/into more places",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 376,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 379,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "1442c48db148caa98ce03cdb79a21387559f2fbe",
