      "writtenOn": "2024-11-15T12:02:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hey Julia, the reasoning would be very similar to the one I provided in Geocoder, for various reasons we and other developers, need/want to disable certain services, which in this case would nullify some of the framework components. So null checking to handle it gracefully.\n\nThis is not necessary a bug, as it is an option that all developers have to toggle on/off services. It\u0027s just a matter of making the process easier and more robust to such allowed actions. Hope that clarifies things 😊",
      "parentUuid": "f0c6361a_2d58b977",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 376,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 379,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "1442c48db148caa98ce03cdb79a21387559f2fbe",
