      "writtenOn": "2024-11-15T14:59:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would you be able to give some more concrete details about exactly what you\u0027re doing, and what \"disable certain services\" involves? I think that will help us better understand why this change is needed.\n\nIf there\u0027s details that you\u0027re not able to share publicly, could you put them in a partner issue instead? Assign it to jbibik@ or reply with the link here and we can continue the discussion there.\n\nhttps://issuetracker.google.com/issues/new?component\u003d1025092\u0026template\u003d0",
      "parentUuid": "6de56bec_a55665ce",
